{"v":4,"catch":"―― 我是為了與你合而為一，才降生到這個世上的 ――","desc":"▶《遊魂 -Kiss on my Deity-》簡介\n主角泉戶裕理是八衢神社的獨子。某天，他與神社土地的守護者相遇，守護者將少女「真白」託付給了他。然而，原本作為危險存在而被封印的「太轉依」卻也因意外被釋放。擁有除魔靈能的裕理，將與包括青梅竹馬在內的4位美少女一同成長，探索如何與非人類的未知生物和平共處。","publisher":"Frontier Works","release":"2025-03-27","genres":["冒險","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 5.6GB / Switch 5.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7585e44b5343ae7f455ec2734b10abd01534c4a25bc5410a3b225586b2978df3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3a3b2ec5c206d2e25d2de9aa5ecdc6d49f8ddbb07dde050a8064a0c82079cdc4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d4e68f045ea02732ad4083563c78fdab112f34feb7aae06fb1dcd4f42ca169d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e57fcac9674e794f4f5a7b6479d3981c808521709d9485adb91a9ab2edf2abd8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e2ef568e8a0e3b6c094ce6db3ddefd14cf0c90a65b77bf996a87baa37b39ff6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/39f09803ab9dee845b0da7e295f4dbed71c5cd8a371478dbcf9a218b5148fbde.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ea8021df0000","dlc":[]}